## 7. Learning Outcomes
- Built a complete ML workflow: feature matrix, split, train, predict, evaluate.
- Read confusion matrices and classification reports (precision, recall, F1).
- Understood overfitting through the depth vs accuracy curve.
- Learned why accuracy alone is unreliable on imbalanced data.
- Visualized a tree and turned it into explainable IF-THEN rules for decision support.
